{"id":"huntik:page:17698","page_id":17698,"title":"Unnamed Suit 025","kind":"character","namespace":0,"summary":"Unnamed Suit 025 is a Suit within the Organization. He operates from Vienna, Austria, under Klaus.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:Suit 025.png","wikitext":"File:Suit 025.png","links":[]},"aliases":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]},"relations":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]},"base":{"text":"Vienna, Austria","wikitext":"[[Vienna, Austria]]","links":[{"target_title":"Vienna, Austria","label":"Vienna, Austria","target_id":"huntik:page:8234","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Vienna%2C_Austria","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Vienna%2C%20Austria"}]},"group":{"text":"The Organization \n Suits","wikitext":"[[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]","links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"}]},"first":{"text":"\"Home Turf\"","wikitext":"\"[[Home Turf]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"Home Turf","label":"Home Turf","target_id":"huntik:page:3228","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Home_Turf","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3228"}]},"last":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]},"gender":{"text":"Male","wikitext":"Male","links":[]},"hair":{"text":"Blonde","wikitext":"Blonde","links":[]},"eyes":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]},"va":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"infobox character","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"File:Suit 025.png","value_text":"File:Suit 025.png","links":[]},{"name":"aliases","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]},{"name":"relations","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]},{"name":"base","value_wikitext":"[[Vienna, Austria]]","value_text":"Vienna, Austria","links":[{"target_title":"Vienna, Austria","label":"Vienna, Austria","target_id":"huntik:page:8234","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Vienna%2C_Austria","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Vienna%2C%20Austria"}]},{"name":"group","value_wikitext":"[[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]","value_text":"The Organization \n Suits","links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[Home Turf]]\"","value_text":"\"Home Turf\"","links":[{"target_title":"Home Turf","label":"Home Turf","target_id":"huntik:page:3228","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Home_Turf","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3228"}]},{"name":"last","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]},{"name":"gender","value_wikitext":"Male","value_text":"Male","links":[]},{"name":"hair","value_wikitext":"Blonde","value_text":"Blonde","links":[]},{"name":"eyes","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]},{"name":"va","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]}],"start":0,"end":295}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"This Suit was sent by [[Klaus]], under the instructions of [[Rassimov]], to go after [[Dante Vale]] in [[County Kerry, Ireland]]. His team of Suits ambushed [[Scarlet Byrne]] and Dante's team in the [[New Grange Passage Tomb]] but were eventually defeated. {{source|Home Turf}}\n\nThis Suit later was sent to [[Valley of the Kings, Egypt]]. Here, [[Sophie Casterwill]] led both him and [[unnamed Suit 025]] away from the excavation of the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]]. He attempted to cast [[Augerfrost]] on Sophie but was hit by Sophie's [[Doublespell]] [[Raypulse]]. Subsequently, the two were knocked out by Dante. He later joined the effort to track down Dante's team within the tomb. Upon catching up to Dante's team at a pool, he attacked with a [[Raypulse]] and later invoked [[Enforcer]].  {{source|The Sceptre Deception}}\n\nThis Suit later fought against [[Rassimov]] and [[Harrison Fears]] outside Nefertiti's Tomb. He attempted to invoke [[Ammit Heart-Eater]] but was completely ensnared by the vines of Rassimov's [[Thornment]]. {{source|Rassimov's Secret}}","text":"This Suit was sent by Klaus, under the instructions of Rassimov, to go after Dante Vale in County Kerry, Ireland. His team of Suits ambushed Scarlet Byrne and Dante's team in the New Grange Passage Tomb but were eventually defeated. [Home Turf]\n\nThis Suit later was sent to Valley of the Kings, Egypt. Here, Sophie Casterwill led both him and unnamed Suit 025 away from the excavation of the Tomb of Nefertiti. He attempted to cast Augerfrost on Sophie but was hit by Sophie's Doublespell Raypulse. Subsequently, the two were knocked out by Dante. He later joined the effort to track down Dante's team within the tomb. Upon catching up to Dante's team at a pool, he attacked with a Raypulse and later invoked Enforcer. [The Sceptre Deception]\n\nThis Suit later fought against Rassimov and Harrison Fears outside Nefertiti's Tomb. He attempted to invoke Ammit Heart-Eater but was completely ensnared by the vines of Rassimov's Thornment. [Rassimov's Secret]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Raypulse]]\n\n{{col-2}}","text":"* Augerfrost\n* Raypulse"},{"heading":"Bonded Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Ammit Heart-Eater]]\n* [[Enforcer]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"* Ammit Heart-Eater\n* Enforcer"}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 025 is a Suit within the Organization. He operates from Vienna, Austria, under Klaus.\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit was sent by Klaus, under the instructions of Rassimov, to go after Dante Vale in County Kerry, Ireland. His team of Suits ambushed Scarlet Byrne and Dante's team in the New Grange Passage Tomb but were eventually defeated. [Home Turf]\n\nThis Suit later was sent to Valley of the Kings, Egypt. Here, Sophie Casterwill led both him and unnamed Suit 025 away from the excavation of the Tomb of Nefertiti. He attempted to cast Augerfrost on Sophie but was hit by Sophie's Doublespell Raypulse. Subsequently, the two were knocked out by Dante. He later joined the effort to track down Dante's team within the tomb. Upon catching up to Dante's team at a pool, he attacked with a Raypulse and later invoked Enforcer. [The Sceptre Deception]\n\nThis Suit later fought against Rassimov and Harrison Fears outside Nefertiti's Tomb. He attempted to invoke Ammit Heart-Eater but was completely ensnared by the vines of Rassimov's Thornment. [Rassimov's Secret]\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans.\n\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n* Augerfrost\n* Raypulse\n\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n* Ammit Heart-Eater\n* Enforcer","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox character\n| image     = File:Suit 025.png\n| aliases   = \n| relations = \n| base      = [[Vienna, Austria]]\n| group     = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]\n| first     = \"[[Home Turf]]\"\n| last      = \n| gender    = Male\n| hair      = Blonde\n| eyes      = \n| va        = \n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 025''' is a [[Suit]] within [[the Organization]]. He operates from  [[Vienna, Austria]], under [[Klaus]].\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit was sent by [[Klaus]], under the instructions of [[Rassimov]], to go after [[Dante Vale]] in [[County Kerry, Ireland]]. His team of Suits ambushed [[Scarlet Byrne]] and Dante's team in the [[New Grange Passage Tomb]] but were eventually defeated. {{source|Home Turf}}\n\nThis Suit later was sent to [[Valley of the Kings, Egypt]]. Here, [[Sophie Casterwill]] led both him and [[unnamed Suit 025]] away from the excavation of the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]]. He attempted to cast [[Augerfrost]] on Sophie but was hit by Sophie's [[Doublespell]] [[Raypulse]]. Subsequently, the two were knocked out by Dante. He later joined the effort to track down Dante's team within the tomb. Upon catching up to Dante's team at a pool, he attacked with a [[Raypulse]] and later invoked [[Enforcer]].  {{source|The Sceptre Deception}}\n\nThis Suit later fought against [[Rassimov]] and [[Harrison Fears]] outside Nefertiti's Tomb. He attempted to invoke [[Ammit Heart-Eater]] but was completely ensnared by the vines of Rassimov's [[Thornment]]. {{source|Rassimov's Secret}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Raypulse]]\n\n{{col-2}}\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n* [[Ammit Heart-Eater]]\n* [[Enforcer]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_title":"Vienna, Austria","label":"Vienna, Austria","target_id":"huntik:page:8234","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Vienna%2C_Austria","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Vienna%2C%20Austria"},{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Home Turf","label":"Home Turf","target_id":"huntik:page:3228","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Home_Turf","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3228"},{"target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Vienna, Austria","label":"Vienna, Austria","target_id":"huntik:page:8234","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Vienna%2C_Austria","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Vienna%2C%20Austria"},{"target_title":"Klaus","label":"Klaus","target_id":"huntik:page:3241","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Klaus","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3241"},{"target_title":"Klaus","label":"Klaus","target_id":"huntik:page:3241","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Klaus","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3241"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"County Kerry, Ireland","label":"County Kerry, Ireland","target_id":"huntik:page:18337","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/County_Kerry%2C_Ireland","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=County%20Kerry%2C%20Ireland"},{"target_title":"Scarlet Byrne","label":"Scarlet Byrne","target_id":"huntik:page:3099","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sca